   by the competition's OpenReview submission form.

3. Data inside submission/*.zip (data/*/*.parquet, 200 items per benchmark) and the fitted
   artifacts derived from them are measurement-db tables and derivatives; they remain under the
   measurement-db terms (curation contributions CC BY-SA 4.0; individual benchmarks under their
   upstream licences) and are included only to make the submission archive self-contained.

4. The pretrained encoders named in models.txt are not included and keep their own licences.

